  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Inlet Beach Paradise by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br><br>A true coastal escape with an expansive backyard and private pool, welcome to Inlet Beach Paradise. Brand-new, polished, and designed for creating outstanding 30A vacay moments, the vibe is easy, elevated, and entirely yours.<br><br>Highlights:<br>📍 Inlet Beach<br>⛱️ .5 miles to Public Inlet Beach Access!<br>👙 Gorgeous private pool in large backyard!<br>🛏️ 4 bedrooms, 3 baths<br>🔥 Gas grill <br>🪞 Stunning interiors<br>🚲 4 bikes!<br>🕶️ Near Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach<br>🐠 Grouper Reef is a great place to snorkel<br>🦞 5-star restaurants<br> <br>Set in Inlet Beach, this prime location puts you exactly where you want to be. You’re just a half-mile from the shore, so a quick hop on a bike? Absolutely dreamy.<br> <br>Inside, natural light brightens the open living area, while stylish finishes and comfy seating create an easy gathering space, perfect for a regroup after a full day outside.<br> <br>The kitchen is efficient, well-equipped, and ready for anything, from quick breakfasts to unhurried dinners. The dining table is a wonderful setting that tends to host meals that last longer than planned.<br> <br>Bedrooms are bright and peaceful, offering excellent privacy for up to 10 guests. The primary suite is a true standout, featuring its own private balcony for morning coffee and sunset views. The tykes will love the fun bunk room.<br> <br>Also! The Inlet Beach Underpass is designed for pedestrian and cyclist safety at the intersection of Highway 98 and 30A and it provides a safe crossing beneath busy traffic, connecting beach access, shops and restaurants. It includes art murals by local artists.<br> <br>As always, the Oversee 30A team is nearby. Need anything? We’re here every day, plus a 24/7 line for the unexpected.<br> <br>Overview:<br>- .5 miles to the Inlet Public Beach Access<br>- Private pool (can be heated seasonally for an additional $55.00 per day, contact Oversee for details)<br>- Large back yard<br>- 4 bikes included<br>- 4 bedrooms, 3 baths<br>- 2,116 sq ft<br>- Gas grill<br>- Wi-Fi<br> <br>Overnight:<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Guest Room: King bed, ensuite full bath, shower/tub combo<br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, private bath, walk-in shower, private balcony<br>- Guest Room: King bed, shared full bath<br>- Bunk Room: Two twin-over-twin, shared full bath<br> <br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
